IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `swa-works-offences`

-- Street Works Act 1995, ss 8, 8A, 9, 10A(5), 11, 13(3), 17, 32A, 33, 35, 36, 39, 40(2), 49, 52, 53(4) -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_street-works-act-1995.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

